{"meta":{"id":"tt39281887","type":"series","name":"Jaadugar: A Witch in Mongolia","imdb_id":"tt39281887","description":"Tras perder a su madre y a su patria, la desesperación de Sitara se transforma en determinación gracias al poder del conocimiento. Nuevas posibilidades se abren ante ella cuando una familia de eruditos la acoge, profundizando así su educación. Mientras tanto, el Imperio mongol de Gengis Kan conquista una nación tras otra, acercándose al nuevo hogar de Sitara. Cuando el Cuarto Príncipe del imperio la toma como cautiva, se enciende en ella la llama de la venganza.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt39281887.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6AoGMlKo2DUsYWiF5zzjdRERCVi.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMpNy4JJiJH2yDehiDNGyswrWZR.png","genres":["Animación","Drama","War & Politics"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-07-04T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","runtime":"24 min","imdbRating":"8.2","country":"Japan","cast":["関根明良","小清水亜美","桑島法子","齋藤潤","下野紘","鈴木崚汰","入野自由","浪川大輔","野島健児"],"writer":["加藤還一","Tomato Soup"],"trailers":[{"source":"7gCitSBXW6w","type":"Trailer","name":"Pre-Broadcast PV [Subtitled]","ytId":"7gCitSBXW6w","lang":"en"},{"source":"1oPCiZlXnYQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Second Main PV [Subtitled]","ytId":"1oPCiZlXnYQ","lang":"en"},{"source":"AA9GMXHQhR8","type":"Trailer","name":"First Main PV [Subtitled]","ytId":"AA9GMXHQhR8","lang":"en"},{"source":"bNPxBtAXKNc","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer & Anime Announcement","ytId":"bNPxBtAXKNc","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"7gCitSBXW6w","title":"Pre-Broadcast PV [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"1oPCiZlXnYQ","title":"Second Main PV [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"AA9GMXHQhR8","title":"First Main PV [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"bNPxBtAXKNc","title":"Official Trailer & Anime Announcement"}],"links":[{"name":"8.2","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt39281887"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"